# Private household documents. This repository is public: real financial
# plans, statements and exports must never be committed. Kept as patterns
# rather than single filenames so a v10 is covered too.
*.pdf
*Financial_Plan*
plan.local.json
ebreo-snapshot-*.json
Icons_and_logo.zip

# Spreadsheets. Added after a workbook of the real monthly transfer
# arrangement -- every allotment, every account, every amount -- sat untracked
# in this directory for a while. Nothing was committed, but a single
# `git add -A` would have published the household's entire finances.
#
# Patterns, not filenames, because the next one will be called something else.
# No spreadsheet has ever been tracked here, so nothing is lost by this.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.numbers
# Excel's lock file for an open workbook.
~$*
